get_worker_trace.description:
View the [execution process] of an intent (work) (unlike get_worker_output which only gives the final conclusion). Three usages:
① intent_id only → returns a summary stream of every step of the work (summary<=100 chars, includes step_id; just the action outline, no full output);
② intent_id + q → only returns step summaries matching the keyword (searches both summaries and full outputs; still returns summaries only — use ③ for content);
③ intent_id + step_ids (at most 5) → returns the full content (detail) of those steps.
Typical flow: use ①/② to locate suspicious step_ids, then ③ to fetch their full output. Thinking steps are not included.
